dan akar cheongung.

932
00:59:58.761 --> 01:00:00.763
sangat baik. saya faham.

933
01:00:00.847 --> 01:00:02.056
Baiklah.

934
01:00:02.140 --> 01:00:04.058
Permaisuri Janda,
suapkan kepada Putera Besar.

935
01:00:04.142 --> 01:00:05.435
